   "html_text": "Paseau (2024) argues that the Track Record Argument is the strongest argument in favour of trumping naturalism, and analyses in detail different formulations of it. While Paseau believes that science should be given more weight than non-science in our reasoning and in our deliberations (including philosophy), he argues that the argument is not as strong as it is thought by many naturalists. In particular, the No Dogmatism objection undermines the Track Record Argument by pointing out that past f",
